- RustDesk, master branch at commit 001b0e96173cea4e49f9f7a67bea95a177dd1de3 (release 1.5.0 plus
  15 commits; https://github.com/rustdesk/rustdesk), including its libs/hbb_common
  (https://github.com/rustdesk/hbb_common, commit 229b904508364c8997aad0fb5af57effac859f60).
  Copyright (C) Purslane Tech Pte. Ltd. and the RustDesk contributors.
  GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 only.
- rustdesk-server, master branch at commit a7736be5e40f85bfc141120dce587e836e5d4b80 (release 1.1.16
  plus 12 commits, versioned 1.1.17; https://github.com/rustdesk/rustdesk-server).
  Copyright (C) 2022 open-trade and the RustDesk contributors.
  GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or any later version.

What HJViewer changes, since 2026-10-10:
- the patch series in server/patches and client/patches, each with its date and description;
- the replacement image files in client/overlay;
- at build time (.github/workflows/client-build.yml): the app version is set from
  client/version.env, the Android build switches to debug signing and more Gradle memory, the
  iOS build sets its own signing on the Runner target and drops entitlements the provisioning
  profile does not grant, and the Windows package ships the app as HJViewer.exe and leaves out
  RustDesk's printer driver and its closed-source adapter (remote printing is off).
Everything else in this repository (scripts, tools, deploy, docs) is original work; the client
workflow follows the steps of RustDesk's own CI.

